"" data-orig="Growing Environment and Key Production Areas">Growing Environment and Key Production Areas</span></a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-4" href="#Price_Fluctuations_and_Market_Trend_2023%E2%80%932024" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_3" data-source="" data-orig="Price Fluctuations and Market Trend">Price Fluctuations and Market Trend</span> (2023<span class ="tr_" id="tr_4" data-source="" data-orig="–2024">–2024</span>)</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-5" href="#Why_Choose_Us_Direct_Sourcing_from_the_Main_Production_Area" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_5" data-source="" data-orig="Why Choose Us">Why Choose Us</span>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_6" data-source="" data-orig="Direct Sourcing from the Main Production Area">Direct Sourcing from the Main Production Area</span></a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-6" href="#Explore_Bulk_Milk_Thistle_Products_%E2%86%92" >Explorez les produits de chardon-Marie en vrac →</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-7" href="#References_APA_Style" >Références (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_7" data-source="" data-orig="APA Style">APA Style</span>)</a></li></ul></nav></div><h2 data-start="114" data-end="168"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Milk_Thistle_Seed_Best_Price_Direct_from_Farms_in_Hebei"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_8" data-source="" data-orig="Milk Thistle Seed Best Price Direct from Farms in Hebei">Milk Thistle Seed Best Price Direct from Farms in Hebei</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_9" data-source="" data-orig="As of May">As of May</span> 2025, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_10" data-source="" data-orig="the price of">the price of</span> <a href="/fr/milk-thistle-seed-bulk-north-china-production/">graines de chardon-Marie</a> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_11" data-source="" data-orig="has declined from RMB 14/kg in">has declined from RMB 14/kg in</span> 2024 à 12 RMB/kg. Certaines fermes proposent des devis encore plus bas. Cela se traduit par environ <strong data-start="174" data-end="190">$1.66 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_12" data-source="" data-orig="USD/kg">USD/kg</span></strong> et <strong data-start="195" data-end="211"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_13" data-source="" data-orig="€1.53 EUR/kg">€1.53 EUR/kg</span></strong>, basé sur les taux de change récents.</p><h2 class="" data-start="114" data-end="168"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Milk_Thistle_Global_Cultivation_History_and_Development_in_China"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_14" data-source="" data-orig="Milk Thistle Global Cultivation History and Development in China">Milk Thistle Global Cultivation History and Development in China</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p class="" data-start="170" data-end="1157">Chardon-Marie (<em data-start="184" data-end="202">Silybum marianum</em>) <span class ="tr_" id="tr_15" data-source="" data-orig="originates from Europe and North Africa and has been used medicinally in Western countries for over">originates from Europe and North Africa and has been used medicinally in Western countries for over</span> 2,000 années (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_16" data-source="" data-orig="Sun et al.">Sun et al.</span>, 2022). En Chine, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_17" data-source="" data-orig="it was first introduced as an ornamental plant from the UK by the Beijing Botanical Garden in">it was first introduced as an ornamental plant from the UK by the Beijing Botanical Garden in</span> 1952.</p><p class="" data-start="170" data-end="1157"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_18" data-source="" data-orig="Later in">Later in</span> 1972, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_19" data-source="" data-orig="Tianjin Import">Tianjin Import</span> &amp; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_20" data-source="" data-orig="Export Company introduced it from Germany for medicinal cultivation">Export Company introduced it from Germany for medicinal cultivation</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_21" data-source="" data-orig="China Chamber of Commerce of Medicines">China Chamber of Commerce of Medicines</span> &amp; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_22" data-source="" data-orig="Health Products">Health Products</span> [<span class ="tr_" id="tr_23" data-source="" data-orig="CCCMHPIE">CCCMHPIE</span>], 2020). <span class ="tr_" id="tr_24" data-source="" data-orig="The first trial cultivation in Panjin">The first trial cultivation in Panjin</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_25" data-source="" data-orig="Liaoning Province">Liaoning Province</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_26" data-source="" data-orig="began in">began in</span> 1978. Aujourd&#039;hui, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_27" data-source="" data-orig="Panjin has become China&#8217;s largest milk thistle processing and extract export base">Panjin has become China&#8217;s largest milk thistle processing and extract export base</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_28" data-source="" data-orig="Cao et al.">Cao et al.</span>, 2023).</p><p class="" data-start="170" data-end="1157"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_29" data-source="" data-orig="By the 1980s and 1990s">By the 1980s and 1990s</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_30" data-source="" data-orig="its cultivation expanded rapidly across northeastern China">its cultivation expanded rapidly across northeastern China</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_31" data-source="" data-orig="with Liaoning and Heilongjiang provinces together accounting for over">with Liaoning and Heilongjiang provinces together accounting for over</span> 70% <span class ="tr_" id="tr_32" data-source="" data-orig="of the national output">of the national output</span> (Wang, 2021; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_33" data-source="" data-orig="CCCMHPIE">CCCMHPIE</span>, 2020). <span class ="tr_" id="tr_34" data-source="" data-orig="The plant was officially included in the">The plant was officially included in the</span> <em data-start="1052" data-end="1075"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_35" data-source="" data-orig="Chinese Pharmacopoeia">Chinese Pharmacopoeia</span></em> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_36" data-source="" data-orig="and is now a common ingredient in many liver health supplements">and is now a common ingredient in many liver health supplements</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_37" data-source="" data-orig="CCCMHPIE">CCCMHPIE</span>, 2020).</p><h2 class="" data-start="1159" data-end="1206"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Growing_Environment_and_Key_Production_Areas"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_38" data-source="" data-orig="Growing Environment and Key Production Areas">Growing Environment and Key Production Areas</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p class="" data-start="1208" data-end="1613"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_39" data-source="" data-orig="Milk thistle prefers sunny">Milk thistle prefers sunny</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_40" data-source="" data-orig="warm climates and has strong tolerance to cold">warm climates and has strong tolerance to cold</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_41" data-source="" data-orig="drought">drought</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_42" data-source="" data-orig="and heat">and heat</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_43" data-source="" data-orig="It thrives even under summer temperatures reaching 39°C">It thrives even under summer temperatures reaching 39°C</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_44" data-source="" data-orig="Seeds have high germination rates">Seeds have high germination rates</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_45" data-source="" data-orig="above">above</span> 95%) <span class ="tr_" id="tr_46" data-source="" data-orig="in 18–25°C environments and can self-sow easily">in 18–25°C environments and can self-sow easily</span> (Wang, 2021). <span class ="tr_" id="tr_47" data-source="" data-orig="While tolerant of various soil types">While tolerant of various soil types</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_48" data-source="" data-orig="the crop performs best in loose">the crop performs best in loose</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_49" data-source="" data-orig="well-drained sandy loam">well-drained sandy loam</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_50" data-source="" data-orig="It is unsuitable for waterlogged or saline soils">It is unsuitable for waterlogged or saline soils</span>.</p><p class="" data-start="1615" data-end="2097"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_51" data-source="" data-orig="China’s core production areas are in the northeast">China’s core production areas are in the northeast</span>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_52" data-source="" data-orig="Panjin in Liaoning and several counties in Heilongjiang">Panjin in Liaoning and several counties in Heilongjiang</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_53" data-source="" data-orig="such as Sunwu">such as Sunwu</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_54" data-source="" data-orig="Xunke">Xunke</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_55" data-source="" data-orig="Nenjiang">Nenjiang</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_56" data-source="" data-orig="and Jiayin">and Jiayin</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_57" data-source="" data-orig="collectively contribute about">collectively contribute about</span> 70% <span class ="tr_" id="tr_58" data-source="" data-orig="of total national production">of total national production</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_59" data-source="" data-orig="Secondary regions include Jiansanjiang">Secondary regions include Jiansanjiang</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_60" data-source="" data-orig="Mudanjiang">Mudanjiang</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_61" data-source="" data-orig="Suihua">Suihua</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_62" data-source="" data-orig="Daxing’anling">Daxing’anling</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_63" data-source="" data-orig="Heilongjiang">Heilongjiang</span>); <span class ="tr_" id="tr_64" data-source="" data-orig="Yanji">Yanji</span> (Jilin); <span class ="tr_" id="tr_65" data-source="" data-orig="Yakeshi">Yakeshi</span> (Mongolie intérieure); <span class ="tr_" id="tr_66" data-source="" data-orig="Pingliang">Pingliang</span> (Gansu); <span class ="tr_" id="tr_67" data-source="" data-orig="and parts of Shaanxi province such as Lintong and Weinan">and parts of Shaanxi province such as Lintong and Weinan</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_68" data-source="" data-orig="CCCMHPIE">CCCMHPIE</span>, 2020). <span class ="tr_" id="tr_69" data-source="" data-orig="Below is an overview of regional output">Below is an overview of regional output</span>:</p><div class="_tableContainer_16hzy_1"><div class="_tableWrapper_16hzy_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse" tabindex="-1"><table class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="2" data-start="2099" data-end="2622"><thead data-start="2099" data-end="2229"><tr data-start="2099" data-end="2229"><th data-start="2099" data-end="2117" data-col-size="sm"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_70" data-source="" data-orig="Production Tier">Production Tier</span></th><th data-start="2117" data-end="2213" data-col-size="md"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_71" data-source="" data-orig="Key Areas">Key Areas</span></th><th data-start="2213" data-end="2229" data-col-size="sm"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_72" data-source="" data-orig="Output Share">Output Share</span></th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="2362" data-end="2622"><tr data-start="2362" data-end="2492"><td data-start="2362" data-end="2381" data-col-size="sm"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_73" data-source="" data-orig="Core">Core</span></td><td data-col-size="md" data-start="2381" data-end="2476"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_74" data-source="" data-orig="Panjin">Panjin</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_75" data-source="" data-orig="Liaoning">Liaoning</span>); <span class ="tr_" id="tr_76" data-source="" data-orig="Sunwu">Sunwu</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_77" data-source="" data-orig="Xunke">Xunke</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_78" data-source="" data-orig="Nenjiang">Nenjiang</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_79" data-source="" data-orig="Jiayin">Jiayin</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_80" data-source="" data-orig="Heilongjiang">Heilongjiang</span>)</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2476" data-end="2492"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_81" data-source="" data-orig="~70%">~70%</span></td></tr><tr data-start="2493" data-end="2622"><td data-start="2493" data-end="2512" data-col-size="sm"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_82" data-source="" data-orig="Secondary">Secondary</span></td><td data-col-size="md" data-start="2512" data-end="2606"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_83" data-source="" data-orig="Jiansanjiang">Jiansanjiang</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_84" data-source="" data-orig="Mudanjiang">Mudanjiang</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_85" data-source="" data-orig="Suihua">Suihua</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_86" data-source="" data-orig="Daxing’anling">Daxing’anling</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_87" data-source="" data-orig="Yanji">Yanji</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_88" data-source="" data-orig="Yakeshi">Yakeshi</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_89" data-source="" data-orig="Pingliang">Pingliang</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_90" data-source="" data-orig="Lintong">Lintong</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_91" data-source="" data-orig="Weinan">Weinan</span></td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2606" data-end="2622"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_92" data-source="" data-orig="~30%">~30%</span></td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end"></div></div></div></div><h2 class="" data-start="2624" data-end="2674"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Price_Fluctuations_and_Market_Trend_2023%E2%80%932024"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_93" data-source="" data-orig="Price Fluctuations and Market Trend">Price Fluctuations and Market Trend</span> (2023<span class ="tr_" id="tr_94" data-source="" data-orig="–2024">–2024</span>)<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p class="" data-start="2676" data-end="3042"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_95" data-source="" data-orig="Milk thistle seed prices have shown major volatility over the past two decades">Milk thistle seed prices have shown major volatility over the past two decades</span>. Dans 2003, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_96" data-source="" data-orig="strong demand drove the price up to a historic high of around RMB 30/kg">strong demand drove the price up to a historic high of around RMB 30/kg</span>. Cependant, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_97" data-source="" data-orig="oversupply quickly followed">oversupply quickly followed</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_98" data-source="" data-orig="pushing prices down to RMB 5.5/kg by 2004–2005 and discouraging farmers from continuing cultivation">pushing prices down to RMB 5.5/kg by 2004–2005 and discouraging farmers from continuing cultivation</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_99" data-source="" data-orig="CCCMHPIE">CCCMHPIE</span>, 2020). <span class ="tr_" id="tr_100" data-source="" data-orig="Prices stabilized around RMB 8–13/kg after">Prices stabilized around RMB 8–13/kg after</span> 2008.</p><p class="" data-start="3044" data-end="3519">Dans 2020, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_101" data-source="" data-orig="the market saw renewed demand and tight supply">the market saw renewed demand and tight supply</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_102" data-source="" data-orig="Procurement prices rose sharply from RMB 8,067/ton in">Procurement prices rose sharply from RMB 8,067/ton in</span> 2020 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_103" data-source="" data-orig="to RMB 11,550.76/ton in">to RMB 11,550.76/ton in</span> 2021, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_104" data-source="" data-orig="representing a">representing a</span> 43.2% <span class ="tr_" id="tr_105" data-source="" data-orig="increase">increase</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_106" data-source="" data-orig="Inner Mongolia HHSY Biotechnology Co.">Inner Mongolia HHSY Biotechnology Co.</span>, 2022). <span class ="tr_" id="tr_107" data-source="" data-orig="The trend continued into 2023–2024">The trend continued into 2023–2024</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_108" data-source="" data-orig="with limited raw material availability and growing international demand for silymarin—a liver-protective compound extracted from milk thistle—driving sustained interest in direct sourcing from origin-based suppliers">with limited raw material availability and growing international demand for silymarin—a liver-protective compound extracted from milk thistle—driving sustained interest in direct sourcing from origin-based suppliers</span>.</p><hr class="" data-start="3521" data-end="3524" /><h2 class="" data-start="3526" data-end="3589"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Why_Choose_Us_Direct_Sourcing_from_the_Main_Production_Area"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_109" data-source="" data-orig="Why Choose Us">Why Choose Us</span>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_110" data-source="" data-orig="Direct Sourcing from the Main Production Area">Direct Sourcing from the Main Production Area</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p class="" data-start="3591" data-end="3753"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_111" data-source="" data-orig="Our company is based in Panjin">Our company is based in Panjin</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_112" data-source="" data-orig="Liaoning—China’s core production zone for milk thistle seeds">Liaoning—China’s core production zone for milk thistle seeds</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_113" data-source="" data-orig="By working directly with local growers and processors">By working directly with local growers and processors</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_114" data-source="" data-orig="we guarantee">we guarantee</span>:</p><ul data-start="3755" data-end="3929"><li class="" data-start="3755" data-end="3790"><p class="" data-start="3757" data-end="3790"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_115" data-source="" data-ori